do_2 = "Land the Sequential implementation first (D19): each tx runs on its own branch of L_open through the CacheTxContext pattern (sdk/baseapp/baseapp.go:822) and the DeliverTx path (node/abci.go:169). The branch is written back on success and dropped on failure."
do_3 = "Add the MicroBatch implementation over DeliverTxBatch (node/abci.go:230) and its scheduler (:247) behind a mode switch. The switch is made under measurement; the micro-batch maximum tx count is set at activation rehearsal."
do_4 = "Add the future-nonce queue: a tx whose nonce is above the next nonce waits in node/sequencer and is accepted in nonce order. In deliver mode the ante check requires nonce == next (modules/evm/ante/sig.go:70-80, :75). A same-nonce replacement is refused."
do_5 = "Add node/sequencer/executor_test.go: the same tx stream run in Sequential and MicroBatch mode yields byte-identical receipts and the same resulting state, with queued future nonces drained in order."
