do_3 = "FinalizeBlocker (node/app.go:1551) writes the COMMITTED WAL entry, adopts L_N as the state to commit when the block equals the sealed slice (otherwise it re-executes), and stores the block's DecidedLastCommit in the modules/sequencer vote store."
